SCHEMA_VERSION='watermark/v3'
PROMPT = ('Classify ALL visible marks on the first original image. Return one JSON object only, schema_version=watermark/v3. '
          'Required top-level fields: schema_version, task_type, item_id, confidence, abstain, image_size, '
          'coverage_complete, no_marks_detected, marks, unresolved_items, evidence_ids. '
          'task_type must be watermark; item_id equals item.id. image_size=[width,height] must equal item.dimensions. '
          'Each visible text/logo/banner/signature is a separate mark with REQUIRED fields mark_id, classification, owner, '
          'location, bbox_xyxy, confidence, abstain, evidence_ids. mark_id is unique within this result. '
          'bbox_xyxy uses ORIGINAL image pixels [x0,y0,x1,y1], bounded by image_size; never use crop-sheet coordinates. '
          'classification is one of official_marketing_text, third_party_store_banner, chinese_promotion_poster, '
          'third_party_store_logo, social_account_signature, manufacturer_branding, product_print, marketing_text, '
          'photographer_credit, unknown. Do not return decision or a single root-level classification/owner/location. '
          'owner and location are non-empty strings; use unknown when unproven. '
          'If a mark ownership is unclear, use classification=unknown and abstain=true on THAT mark; retain other observations. '
          'All confidence fields are JSON numbers 0..1 and abstain/coverage_complete/no_marks_detected are booleans. '
          'coverage_complete=true only if all visible marks were inspected. Empty marks requires '
          'no_marks_detected=true AND coverage_complete=true; otherwise keep incomplete coverage. '
          'unresolved_items is an array of {reason_code,location,evidence_ids}; preserve observed marks even when abstaining. '
          'All root/mark/unresolved evidence_ids must reference supplied evidence. '
          'Preserve photographer credits, social signatures, manufacturer brands, product printing, copyright and packaging. '
          'Text physically printed on a product or retail box is product_print/manufacturer_branding unless there is evidence of an added seller overlay; '
          'illegible package fine print or an unknown manufacturer name alone is not an unresolved seller-watermark finding. '
          'A copyright line such as All Rights Reserved / copyright / photographed by plus a studio or photographer name is a protected photographer_credit; '
          'do not require a studio name to be proven a store before preserving an evident photographic credit. '
          'A studio name without credit context may still be uncertain: inspect the original pixels and OCR crops, never guess ownership. '
          'Auxiliary OCR/highpass views support localization; they do not transfer a reference image mark to the target.')
